स गुणान्समतीत्यैतान्ब्रह्मभूयाय कल्पते ॥ २६ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3971,\"bb\":3492,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/14/26/b3492/\",\"body_value\":\"māṁ ca yo ’vyabhicāreṇa
