sukhasyaikāntikasya ca\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":3978,\"bb\":3498,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/14/27/b3498/\",\"shadow_value\":\"brahmaṇaḥ – of the impersonal brahma-jyotir; hi – certainly; pratiṣṭhā – the rest; aham – I am; amṛtasya – of the immortal; avyayasya – of the imperishable; ca – also; śāśvatasya – of the eternal; ca – and; dharmasya – of the constitutional position; sukhasya – of happiness; aikāntikasya – ultimate; ca – also.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"brahmaṇaḥ\",\"translation\":\"of the impersonal brahma-jyotir\"},{\"word\":\"hi\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"pratiṣṭhā\",\"translation\":\"the rest\"},{\"word\":\"aham\",\"translation\":\"I am\"},{\"word\":\"amṛtasya\",\"translation\":\"of the immortal\"},{\"word\":\"avyayasya\",\"translation\":\"of the imperishable\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"śāśvatasya\",\"translation\":\"of the eternal\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"and\"},{\"word\":\"dharmasya\",\"translation\":\"of the constitutional position\"},{\"word\":\"sukhasya\",\"translation\":\"of happiness\"},{\"word\":\"aikāntikasya\",\"translation\":\"ultimate\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":3979,\"bb\":3499,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/14/27/b3499/\",\"body_value\":\"And I am the basis of the impersonal Brahman, which is immortal, imperishable and eternal and is the constitutional position of ultimate happiness.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3980,\"bb\":3500,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/14/27/b3500/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3981,\"b